{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48817","headline":"柳宜城鹊巢歌 · 顾况","name":"柳宜城鹊巢歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相公宅前杨柳树，野鹊飞来复飞去。\n东家斫树枝，西家斫树枝。\n东家西家斫树枝，发遣野鹊巢何枝。\n相君处分留野鹊，一月生得三个儿。\n相君长命复富贵，口舌贫穷徒尔爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48817.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48817","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}